### Lab 6: Quorum values (Riak HTTP API options are version/configuration dependent)
### Example write with W=2 and DW=2, if supported by your Riak version/configuration
curl -i -X PUT 'http://127.0.0.1:8098/buckets/quorum_demo/keys/item1?w=2&dw=2' \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '{"message":"write with W=2 and DW=2"}'

### Example read with R=2, if supported
curl -i 'http://127.0.0.1:8098/buckets/quorum_demo/keys/item1?r=2'

### Notes:
### R/W/DW must be compatible with bucket N value and available replicas.
### Quorum settings affect how many replicas must respond; they do not create full ACID transactions.
### Confirm supported parameter names/defaults for the installed Riak release.
